{"5022800": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Raven Errant", "steam_appid": 5022800, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where battle rages, the Ravens wander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the turmoil of slaughter around you, steal and scavenge from the bodies of the fallen (before they rot away to dust taking their precious loot and XP with them).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tUpgrade your stats and equipment to become a true champion of terror on the battlefield!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tWield an array of medieval weapons for your prefered combat style, guard behind a shield and wait for your chance to strike, or go all in with powerful two handed weapons for maximum damage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tMove fleet footed with light, maneuverable protection or turn yourself into a walking tank with multiple layers of heavy armor (just don't get out of your depth in water).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tEnlist with roaming bands of raiders to loot and pillage sites, not just for the free XP, but also for safety in numbers - or go it alone against all comers as a one man medieval death machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tEvery game run boosts your permanent stats for the next. Death may come to us all, just remember to loot your corpse for lost XP! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tRaiders and warbands come and go, but on the battlefield, only the Raven remains.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Where battle rages, the Ravens wander.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the turmoil of slaughter around you, steal and scavenge from the bodies of the fallen (before they rot away to dust taking their precious loot and XP with them).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\tUpgrade your stats and equipment to become a true champion of terror on the battlefield!</p><p cla